---
// Testing mode warning banner
---

<div class="bg-amber-50 border-b border-amber-200 px-4 py-3">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
      </svg>
      <span class="text-amber-900 text-sm font-medium">This service is currently in testing mode. Data may be reset without notice. For more information or any data protection requests, please email <a href="mailto:hello@youthacks.org" class="text-amber-700 underline">hello@youthacks.org</a> or <a href="mailto:gdpr@youthacks.org" class="text-amber-700 underline">gdpr@youthacks.org</a> respectively.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
